    {
      "id": "HqrqH5wSiB4Ovn0CTUWH9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 953,
      "y": 185,
      "width": 531.9674682617188,
      "height": 460,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1102908544,
      "version": 629,
      "versionNonce": 21646208,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789999590850,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How to \"install\" a UI:\n- App Store?\n    - \"Native apps\"\n- Web Application\n    - Server Side\n        - Easier - Stateless\n        - ASP.NET MVC w/Razor Pages\n    - SSR Server-Side Rendering\n        - Render the initial page at the server\n        - JS takes over from there.\n    - Static Site Generation\n    - SPA\n        - \"Single Page Application\"\n        - Web Apps\n            - \"Raw\" javascript\n            - AngularJs -> Angular (17 or so... pretty darned good) 22\n            - React\n            - Vue\n            - Svelte, Elm\n            - Stateful\n            - You download the \"app\"\n              - no need to go to the server\n                to generate HTML, just API calls",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to \"install\" a UI:\n- App Store?\n    - \"Native apps\"\n- Web Application\n    - Server Side\n        - Easier - Stateless\n        - ASP.NET MVC w/Razor Pages\n    - SSR Server-Side Rendering\n        - Render the initial page at the server\n        - JS takes over from there.\n    - Static Site Generation\n    - SPA\n        - \"Single Page Application\"\n        - Web Apps\n            - \"Raw\" javascript\n            - AngularJs -> Angular (17 or so... pretty darned good) 22\n            - React\n            - Vue\n            - Svelte, Elm\n            - Stateful\n            - You download the \"app\"\n              - no need to go to the server\n                to generate HTML, just API calls",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
